@AccessControl.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5257
@accessPointId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@areaId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@employeeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@credentialId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@receptionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@disabledAccessPointId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Areas
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/areas
Accept: application/json

### Puntos de acceso - listado
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-points?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Puntos de acceso - solo habilitados de tipo bodega
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-points?isEnabled=true&type=Warehouse
Accept: application/json

### Puntos de acceso - por id
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-points/{{accessPointId}}
Accept: application/json

### Puntos de acceso - registrar
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Torniquete muelle de carga",
  "description": "Acceso del personal al muelle de carga",
  "type": "RestrictedArea"
}

### Puntos de acceso - registrar con nombre repetido (409)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Parqueadero",
  "type": "Parking"
}

### Puntos de acceso - registrar con datos inválidos (400)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AB",
  "type": "Garage"
}

### Puntos de acceso - deshabilitar
PATCH {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-points/{{accessPointId}}/disable

### Puntos de acceso - habilitar
PATCH {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access-points/{{accessPointId}}/enable

### Empleados - listado
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Empleados - filtrar por estado y búsqueda
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees?status=Active&search=gomez
Accept: application/json

### Empleados - por id
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Accept: application/json

### Empleados - registrar
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1001234567",
  "firstName": "Mateo",
  "lastName": "Cardona",
  "email": "mateo.cardona@empresa.com",
  "position": "Operario de despacho",
  "areaId": "{{areaId}}"
}

### Empleados - registrar con identificación repetida (409)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "1036625478",
  "firstName": "Laura",
  "lastName": "Gómez",
  "email": "otra.laura@empresa.com",
  "position": "Auxiliar",
  "areaId": "{{areaId}}"
}

### Empleados - registrar con datos inválidos (400)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentNumber": "10.36",
  "firstName": "M",
  "lastName": "Cardona",
  "email": "correo-invalido",
  "position": "Operario",
  "areaId": "{{areaId}}"
}

### Empleados - actualizar
PUT {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mateo",
  "lastName": "Cardona Ruiz",
  "email": "mateo.cardona@empresa.com",
  "position": "Líder de despacho",
  "areaId": "{{areaId}}"
}

### Empleados - desactivar
PATCH {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}/deactivate

### Credenciales - consultar estado por código
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/code/CRD-1001
Accept: application/json

### Credenciales - consultar código que no existe (404)
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/code/CRD-9999
Accept: application/json

### Credenciales - credenciales de un empleado
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/employee/{{employeeId}}
Accept: application/json

### Credenciales - asignar
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "code": "CRD-2001"
}

### Credenciales - asignar código repetido (409)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "code": "CRD-1001"
}

### Credenciales - bloquear
PATCH {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/{{credentialId}}/block
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "El empleado reportó la pérdida del carné"
}

### Credenciales - desbloquear
PATCH {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/{{credentialId}}/unblock

### Credenciales - revocar
PATCH {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/{{credentialId}}/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Cambio de carné por deterioro"
}

### Accesos - entrada autorizada (Laura, CRD-1001)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1001",
  "accessPointId": "{{receptionId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

### Accesos - segunda entrada sin salida (rechazado)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1001",
  "accessPointId": "{{receptionId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

### Accesos - salida autorizada
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1001",
  "accessPointId": "{{receptionId}}",
  "movementType": "Exit"
}

### Accesos - salida sin entrada previa (rechazado)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1002",
  "accessPointId": "{{receptionId}}",
  "movementType": "Exit"
}

### Accesos - credencial bloqueada (rechazado)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1003",
  "accessPointId": "{{receptionId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

### Accesos - empleado inactivo (rechazado)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1004",
  "accessPointId": "{{receptionId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

### Accesos - punto de acceso deshabilitado (rechazado)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1002",
  "accessPointId": "{{disabledAccessPointId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

### Accesos - credencial que no existe (rechazado)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-9999",
  "accessPointId": "{{receptionId}}",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

### Accesos - punto de acceso que no existe (404)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1001",
  "accessPointId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "movementType": "Entry"
}

### Accesos - tipo de movimiento inválido (400)
POST {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-1001",
  "accessPointId": "{{receptionId}}",
  "movementType": "Inside"
}

### Historial - todos los accesos
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Historial - por empleado
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?employeeId={{employeeId}}
Accept: application/json

### Historial - por punto de acceso
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?accessPointId={{receptionId}}
Accept: application/json

### Historial - solo rechazados
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?result=Rejected
Accept: application/json

### Historial - por rango de fechas
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?fromDate=2026-10-01&toDate=2026-10-31
Accept: application/json

### Historial - filtros combinados
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?accessPointId={{receptionId}}&result=Authorized&fromDate=2026-10-01&toDate=2026-10-31&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Historial - rango de fechas inválido (400)
GET {{AccessControl.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?fromDate=2026-10-31&toDate=2026-10-01
Accept: application/json
